# EAS Build archives the whole git repository root (not just frontend/),
# and as soon as this file exists it REPLACES every .gitignore in the repo
# for archiving purposes (root .gitignore and frontend/.gitignore both stop
# being consulted) — see https://docs.expo.dev/build-reference/easignore/
# and https://github.com/expo/eas-cli/issues/4259. So every exclusion
# needed anywhere in the repo has to be listed here, not just the new ones.
#
# Why this file exists: only frontend/ (the Expo/React Native app) is
# needed to build the Android/iOS app. backend/ (Node/Express API),
# ai-service/ (Flask AI service, including its Python .venv and trained
# model files) and tests/ (Playwright) are unrelated to the client build
# and were being uploaded anyway — ballooning the upload to ~139MB, which
# is almost certainly why two uploads in a row dropped mid-transfer
# (ECONNRESET, then a 502) instead of completing quickly.

/ai-service
/backend
/tests
/.github
/.git
/README.md

# Mirrors frontend/.gitignore, which is no longer applied once this file
# exists — without this, frontend/node_modules/ (~366MB) would upload too.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.expo/
frontend/dist/
frontend/web-build/
frontend/expo-env.d.ts
frontend/.kotlin/
frontend/*.orig.*
frontend/*.jks
frontend/*.p8
frontend/*.p12
frontend/*.key
frontend/*.mobileprovision
frontend/.metro-health-check*
frontend/npm-debug.*
frontend/yarn-debug.*
frontend/yarn-error.*
frontend/.DS_Store
frontend/*.pem
frontend/.env*.local
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
frontend/ios
frontend/android
